{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新制服‼"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/24/2325497/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏用で半袖パフスリーブ\n私のシャツは水色です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/24/2325497/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リボンがめっちゃかわいいの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな制服見たことない‼\n今までの制服の中で一番すき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/24/2325497/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪\nかわいい‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前みなみと一緒に\nさゆにゃん家にお泊りしてきた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/24/2325497/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったーわ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんブログに\nパックしてる写真載ってるけど、\nさゆにゃん本当はメガネも\nかけてたんよ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パックonメガネ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑いすぎてちゃんと\n写真撮れんかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/24/2325497/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わはは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/24/2325497/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すいか食べました。\nおいしいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/24/2325497/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏だね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/24/2325497/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日に焼けないようにしなきゃだなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}